WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:34.750


2
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:40.666
<b>The nature of the soul is such that it's rare</b>
<b>to find people who understand it.</b>

3
00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:42.875
<b>And explaining this very point,</b>

4
00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.500
<b>Lord Krishna says</b>

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.250
<b>that some see the soul's nature as wondrous,</b>

6
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:54.166
<b>some describe it as wondrous,</b>

7
00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:57.791
<b>some hear of it with wonder...</b>

8
00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:03.375
<b>and some, even after hearing its</b>
<b>complete nature, cannot understand it.</b>

9
00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:08.458


10
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:14.791
<b>Surely, this eternal nature of the soul</b>
<b>neither born nor dying</b>

11
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:17.250
<b>must be amazing you too.</b>

12
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.541
<b>Many questions,</b>

13
00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:20.208
<b>many doubts must exist.</b>

14
00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:24.583
<b>All these will be answered</b>
<b>in time through this Gita...</b>

15
00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:28.583
<b>Lord Krishna will resolve every doubt...</b>

16
00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:32.083
<b>Perhaps this is Arjun's state too,</b>

17
00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:34.708
<b>in his mind also exist many dilemmas,</b>

18
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:36.125
<b>many questions.</b>

19
00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:38.250
<b>And seeing his condition,</b>

20
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.833
<b>Lord Krishna says...</b>

21
00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:40.791
<b>“Yes,</b>

22
00:01:40.791 --> 00:01:43.250
<b>this form of the soul is unique,</b>

23
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.375
<b>it's not easy to understand...”</b>

24
00:01:46.375 --> 00:01:49.500
<b>Here He speaks of three types of people...</b>

25
00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.375
<b>First</b>

26
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:54.083
<b>those who look at this form of</b>
<b>the soul with great wonder,</b>

27
00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:55.041
<b>Second</b>

28
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:58.166
<b>those who describe this form as 'wonderful',</b>

29
00:01:58.166 --> 00:01:59.000
<b>Third</b>

30
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.333
<b>those who are amazed just hearing about it.</b>

31
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:07.708
<b>And these are people who understand</b>
<b>this form somewhat.</b>

32
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:09.125
<b>After intense penance</b>

33
00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:11.208
<b>and acquiring knowledge,</b>

34
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:16.791
<b>when they finally understand this form,</b>
<b>they are greatly amazed.</b>

35
00:02:16.791 --> 00:02:17.791
<b>While</b>

36
00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:22.125
<b>there are many who don't possess this wealth</b>
<b>of penance and knowledge,</b>

37
00:02:22.125 --> 00:02:26.291
<b>and therefore, no matter how much they</b>
<b>hear about the soul,</b>

38
00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:28.458
<b>they cannot understand it.</b>

39
00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:32.833


40
00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:38.041
<b>Imagine you're surrounded by</b>
<b>a serious problem.</b>

41
00:02:38.041 --> 00:02:43.000
<b>You've tried thousands of ways</b>
<b>but found no solution,</b>

42
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.458
<b>explored many paths</b>

43
00:02:44.458 --> 00:02:47.250
<b>but all seem closed.</b>

44
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.916
<b>And just then,</b>

45
00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:56.916
<b>someone comes and whispers something</b>
<b>in your ear, and walks away smiling.</b>

46
00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:58.541
<b>You're amazed,</b>

47
00:02:58.541 --> 00:03:02.750
<b>your eyes remain wide open in wonder.</b>

48
00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:03.916
<b>Because</b>

49
00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:07.541
<b>that person not only suggested a solution,</b>

50
00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:08.333
<b>but</b>

51
00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:11.958
<b>that solution was with you all along,</b>

52
00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:16.833
<b>you just never noticed it.</b>

53
00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:20.625
<b>How astonishing must this experience be.</b>

54
00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:23.375
<b>How liberating.</b>

55
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:26.750
<b>Understanding your spiritual perspective,</b>

56
00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:30.541
<b>knowing it, is just like this.</b>

57
00:03:30.541 --> 00:03:37.083
<b>Sometimes humans spend their</b>
<b>entire life searching for their purpose,</b>

58
00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:40.375
<b>finding solutions to worldly problems,</b>

59
00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:44.708
<b>seeking keys to relationships.</b>

60
00:03:44.708 --> 00:03:46.041
<b>But</b>

61
00:03:46.041 --> 00:03:49.416
<b>when they discover the truth of spirituality,</b>

62
00:03:49.416 --> 00:03:51.750
<b>they realize</b>

63
00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:56.916
<b>how simple and effective every answer was.</b>

64
00:03:56.916 --> 00:04:02.000
<b>It's as if you're busy gathering wealth for living,</b>

65
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.708
<b>and suddenly one day you discover</b>

66
00:04:05.708 --> 00:04:11.208
<b>that right beneath your own home lies</b>
<b>an infinite treasure.</b>

67
00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:14.666
<b>Unearth this buried treasure of spirituality,</b>

68
00:04:14.666 --> 00:04:16.083
<b>understand it,</b>

69
00:04:16.083 --> 00:04:17.916
<b>use it.</b>

70
00:04:18.416 --> 00:04:22.291
<b> </b>

71
00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:25.208
<b>Every person has their own capabilities.</b>

72
00:04:25.208 --> 00:04:28.500
<b>Some are proficient in physical activities,</b>

73
00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.916
<b>some are powerful in mental perspective,</b>

74
00:04:32.916 --> 00:04:39.291
<b>while others know how to</b>
<b>spread the magic of relationships.</b>

75
00:04:39.291 --> 00:04:40.666
<b>There's no one</b>

76
00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:44.875
<b>who is completely devoid of powers.</b>

77
00:04:44.875 --> 00:04:52.375
<b>Within everyone lies a unique diamond</b>
<b>that no one can steal.</b>

78
00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:59.125
<b>The only difference is that some have recognized</b>
<b>this diamond and are busy polishing it,</b>

79
00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:00.166
<b>while</b>

80
00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:04.208
<b>others haven't yet discovered it.</b>

81
00:05:04.208 --> 00:05:05.333
<b>Similarly,</b>

82
00:05:05.333 --> 00:05:07.583
<b>with the truth of the soul</b>

83
00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:10.083
<b>some are engaged in polishing it,</b>

84
00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:12.333
<b>some are still searching,</b>

85
00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:16.708
<b>and some haven't even begun their search.</b>

86
00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:17.500
<b>But</b>

87
00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:21.000
<b>this diamond surely lies hidden in everyone.</b>

88
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:25.625
<b>These teachings of the</b>
<b>Gita will help in your search.</b>

89
00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:30.000
<b>And moreover, since everyone has this diamond,</b>

90
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.500
<b>no one can steal it,</b>

91
00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:37.333
<b>so make an effort to not only walk</b>
<b>this path of discovery yourself,</b>

92
00:05:37.333 --> 00:05:38.333
<b>but</b>

93
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:41.458
<b>also help others.</b>

94
00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:45.708
<b>This is wealth that increases by sharing.</b>

95
00:05:46.333 --> 00:05:50.625


96
00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:55.166
<b>You must have said this yourself at some point,</b>

97
00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:57.833
<b>or perhaps heard it from others</b>

98
00:05:57.833 --> 00:06:00.958
<b>how small this world truly is.</b>

99
00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:04.875
<b>You might have even experienced</b>
<b>this truth firsthand.</b>

100
00:06:04.875 --> 00:06:06.625
<b>For instance,</b>

101
00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:11.083
<b>you visit an office with a</b>
<b>seemingly impossible task at hand,</b>

102
00:06:11.083 --> 00:06:12.500
<b>and suddenly,</b>

103
00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:18.458
<b>you encounter someone you</b>
<b>never expected to meet.</b>

104
00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:20.833
<b>Just like that, your work gets done effortlessly.</b>

105
00:06:20.833 --> 00:06:22.833
<b>You find yourself amazed</b>

106
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:27.500
<b>the person whom you helped with</b>
<b>something minor years ago</b>

107
00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.791
<b>has now come through for you</b>
<b>in such a significant way.</b>

108
00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.500
<b>Today, you realize</b>

109
00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.333
<b>how that simple act of kindness,</b>

110
00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:42.291
<b>which seemed so ordinary then,</b>
<b>created such a profound impact.</b>

111
00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:45.208
<b>Whether you're at the pinnacle</b>
<b>of your professional life</b>

112
00:06:45.208 --> 00:06:46.500
<b>or</b>

113
00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:49.625
<b>still climbing those steps to reach the top,</b>

114
00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:52.625
<b>remain gentle in your approach.</b>

115
00:06:52.625 --> 00:06:56.875
<b>Respect everyone without any hidden agenda.</b>

116
00:06:56.875 --> 00:07:01.375
<b>Help others whenever possible.</b>

117
00:07:01.375 --> 00:07:04.083
<b>Life is both simple and complex.</b>

118
00:07:04.083 --> 00:07:10.625
<b>Simple are the everyday events that unfold,</b>

119
00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:13.416
<b>yet complex is understanding</b>
<b>where their ripples will reach.</b>

120
00:07:13.416 --> 00:07:14.375
<b>But</b>

121
00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:17.666
<b>But ripple they will  this is an</b>
<b>unchangeable truth.</b>

122
00:07:17.666 --> 00:07:20.291
<b>Remember this well.</b>

123
00:07:20.291 --> 00:07:23.166
<b>The spiritual perspective</b>
<b>follows the same principle</b>

124
00:07:23.166 --> 00:07:24.541
<b>It's simple.</b>

125
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:29.083
<b>Walk this path without obsessing</b>
<b>over the destination.</b>

126
00:07:29.083 --> 00:07:33.375
<b>When its full impact manifests in your life,</b>

127
00:07:33.375 --> 00:07:39.958
<b>you'll be both amazed and smile at</b>
<b>its intricate complexity.</b>

128
00:07:39.958 --> 00:07:46.333
<b>Sometimes, these concepts might be</b>
<b>difficult to grasp on an intellectual level.</b>

129
00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:48.500
<b>But following them with faith,</b>

130
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.791
<b>and then experiencing them firsthand</b>

131
00:07:51.791 --> 00:07:56.041
<b>it's truly a magical and fascinating process.</b>

